/* Similar to MIPS16, the two 16-bit halves in microMIPS must be swapped
   on a little-endian system.  This does not apply to R_MICROMIPS_PC7_S1
   and R_MICROMIPS_PC10_S1 relocs that apply to 16-bit instructions.  */

